+    "\n",
+    "For results generated with `SaveRule`, see [selective output](../../docs/selective-output.md). `read_output` returns each output’s own times; do not assume that the first element is frame 0 or that every output has the same length. `plot_output` supports xy/xz/yz planes and x/y/z lines for rho, psi, and phi. The [executable notebook](../workflows/selective_output.ipynb) demonstrates their use.\n"
